WEBVTT

00:00:00.830 --> 00:00:03.260
What? I still can't see him?

00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:06.850
You guys haven't let me see 
him since the other day.

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:09.020
Is he really not feeling well?

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:13.780
<b>Episode 5   "Flower Banquet"</b>

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:14.270
Yes. For the time being, 
Nataku-sama cannot have any visitors.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:17.290
I feel bad that you've been 
coming by every day, but...

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:21.690
I see. I guess it can't be helped 
if he's not feeling well.

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:24.490
Then could you give this to him?

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:27.580
You're supposed to bring flowers 
when you visit sick people, right?

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.250
Yes, of course.

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:31.100
Thanks!

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:37.070
Also, could you tell Nataku 
that my name is Goku?

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:17.910
There is no end to the mayhem down on Earth.

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:22.260
Overlooking such chaos will mar our prestige.

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:26.260
I am ordering you and your army 
to sortie, Prince Nataku.

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:28.020
Do you understand?

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:29.140
Yes.

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:30.660
One moment, please.

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:32.620
Who are you?

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:36.960
From the western army under the command
 of the Dragon King of the Western Sea,

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:39.380
I am General Kenren.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:43.370
What brings you here?

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:45.600
I beg your pardon,

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:52.270
but it appears that Prince Nataku is still wounded
 from his recent battle with Gyumaoh.

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:58.520
I ask that you dispatch my army 
for this mission instead.

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:00.020
What?

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:05.270
<i>This man... was with that kid the other day...</i>

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:11.160
Do you honestly think you 
could take Nataku's place?

00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:13.010
At the very least,

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:18.040
I'm stating that I'm a better option than 
those who hide and come back unharmed.

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:20.500
Kenren! That's enough of your insolence.

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:24.290
I'd prefer that you didn't 
underestimate us, General Kenren.

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:28.330
My son, Nataku, is the 
greatest warrior in Heaven.

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:31.310
Mere wounds will not stop 
him from going into battle

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:35.890
for the sake of Heaven, 
even if would cost him his life.

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:38.490
Isn't that right, Nataku?

00:03:39.350 --> 00:03:40.020
Indeed.

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:44.060
You may take your leave, Nataku.

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:44.890
Yes, sir.

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:49.610
Thanks.

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:58.480
Now then... I believe we're done talking here.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:02.300
Let us escort General Kenren 
to solitary confinement.

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:07.860
Bosatsu... What is that?

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:10.780
Doesn't it look great? I found it somewhere.

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:12.040
Found it?

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:17.380
Yeah. These pitiful little flowers 
were thrown away in a trashcan.

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:25.700
Hey. Did you come down for a visit?

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:30.360
I knew you were a foolish man, 
but to think it was to this extent...

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:33.860
Never a dull moment, am I right, 
Dragon King of the Western Sea?

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:37.730
Why didn't you ask for my help? 
I am your superior officer.

00:04:37.730 --> 00:04:40.860
If I had asked Tentei in your stead...

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:42.720
It wouldn't have made any difference.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:43.500
Not to mention

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:45.880
I just felt like speaking my mind

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:47.130
for whatever reason.

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:50.130
Even though you knew that 
you'd end up like this?

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:52.830
This isn't a big deal.

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:55.470
Nataku jabbing at me hurt way more.

00:04:57.540 --> 00:05:00.810
Acting so mature, 
even though he's only a kid...

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:05.980
Seeing him like that hurts even worse.

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:12.870
But what hurts the most is the when you 
can't even tell anyone that you're hurting.

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:17.620
Kenren was removed from 
his position as general?

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:19.880
Well, they attempted to, anyway...

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:23.120
Apparently Tenpou appealed and 
had them change their minds.

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:28.130
Field Marshal Tenpou 
outranks Li Touten, after all.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:31.560
But we are talking about the same Li Touten

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.890
who's using Nataku's title for his own gain.

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:35.870
I'm sure this isn't the end of it.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:40.180
I wasn't told about any of this.

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:43.430
I'm sure it wasn't worth mentioning.

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:46.090
Am I the only one who didn't know anything?

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:49.290
What the top brass is up to, 
what's going on with the army...

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:51.450
I was basically left out in the cold.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:53.440
This is bullshit.

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:55.700
You little brat.

00:05:56.690 --> 00:05:59.450
Sometimes you have to ask 
questions if you want answers.

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:01.810
Though some of us just never bother.

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:08.210
Will you be able to remain
 that little shrimp's sun?

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:13.060
Well done, Prince Nataku.

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:16.720
I hear you've done splendid work yet again.

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:17.210
Yes, sire.

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:21.290
We are unworthy of your praise.
 We thank you.

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:23.470
<i>You didn't do a damn thing.</i>

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:25.680
You may take your leave.

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:27.270
Get plenty of rest.

00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:28.210
As you wish.

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:33.690
Nataku!

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:37.070
Nataku, over here!

00:06:37.070 --> 00:06:38.240
Welcome back!

00:06:39.570 --> 00:06:40.770
You're...

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:43.250
Father?

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:44.620
That boy...

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:47.830
He's the heretic child that 
was born from the earth, isn't he?

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:49.620
Kill him.

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:52.130
I am certain

00:06:52.130 --> 00:06:54.850
that his existence will someday 
become a threat to us.

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:58.140
We need to get rid of him before that.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.880
Heaven has no need for two disgraces, does it?

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:05.850
Nataku? Nataku!

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:09.280
It's me! Did you forget about me? Nataku!

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:09.950
Nata...

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.940
Were you able to see Nataku?

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:19.300
Well...

00:07:25.060 --> 00:07:26.420
What happened?

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:31.680
How long are you going to sulk?

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:33.090
Go to bed already.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:34.300
I'm not sulking.

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:36.540
How are you not?

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:41.910
I wonder... if Nataku hates me now.

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:47.310
I mean, our eyes met... He saw me...

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:50.600
I'm sure he had his reasons.

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:53.280
What kind of reason is there
 for that? I don't get it!

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:57.530
Besides, he's the one who 
asked me to stay with him.

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:00.280
He seemed a bit lonely.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:06.320
I... I was also alone for a long time, 
so I sort of understand.

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:10.600
When I get lonely, right here 
feels like it's being crushed.

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:16.960
Goku, it might have been a 
mistake to bring you to Heaven.

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:17.830
Huh?

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:20.970
You're not meant to be here.

00:08:20.970 --> 00:08:24.320
You'll probably end up being used 
by those rotten bastards...

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:26.950
Just like Prince Nataku.

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:31.900
I'll talk to Kanzeon Bosatsu tomorrow

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:35.050
about possibly returning you to Earth.

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:36.620
She should be able to...

00:08:37.110 --> 00:08:38.780
Hey, Goku! Wait!

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:41.180
No! Let go of me!

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:43.490
Listen to me, damn it!

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:45.900
Why?! Why would you say 
something like that?!

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:49.930
I just became friends with 
Ten-chan and Ken-niichan...

00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:52.760
And you just gave me a name...

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:56.130
You get mad at me all the time, 
but you've never told me to leave!

00:08:58.010 --> 00:08:59.750
Sorry... Konzen!

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:02.430
I'm sorry, Konzen! Are you okay?

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:03.750
Kon...

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:07.760
I'm not the sun.

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:08.690
Konzen...

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:12.150
By being so indifferent,

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:15.700
I might've just been taking advantage 
of my boring, everyday life.

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:21.500
I don't have any power or know-how 
like Tenpou or Kenren.

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:24.070
Even so...

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:29.090
Even so, I started to think about 
what I could actually do.

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:31.060
It's all your fault.

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:35.180
You're being weird, Konzen. 
Did you hit your head? {lit: did you hit something?}

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:39.080
If you're worried, then take 
responsibility and stay here.

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:41.790
Okay!

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:45.090
Hey...

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:51.010
The first time I saw you, 
I thought you were really pretty.

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:54.640
And I thought that if you smiled,
 you'd be even prettier,

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:56.390
but it really doesn't suit you.

00:09:56.390 --> 00:09:58.610
Do you want to die, you monkey?

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:04.330
<i>That night, Ten-chan and 
Ken-niichan came by unannounced,</i>

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:03.820
I really feel like drinking tonight.

00:10:03.820 --> 00:10:07.110
It's a full moon down on Earth, 
so the blossoms at night are beautiful.

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:06.460
<i>and we all had a flower viewing.</i>

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:09.230
You two...

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:12.000
apparently have nothing better to do.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.830
Well, that's rather rude.

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:20.240
Among all the foods on Earth, ramen is a must.

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:24.470
Konzen makes me ramen 
sometimes, but it's gross.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.540
Would you like me to make it
 for you sometime?

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:27.430
Yeah!

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:30.840
All right, Goku. Why don't 
we climb some trees?

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:33.020
Yeah! Let's race to the top!

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:34.640
Be careful!

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:37.280
I'm going to laugh if you fall, you drunkard.

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:39.770
Tenpou.

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:43.240
Is it possible

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:46.280
for two people to become 
the war god at once?

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:50.670
<b>Sake</b>

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:50.010
So it crossed your mind, too...

00:10:51.140 --> 00:10:54.610
There was a time when there 
were multiple war gods at once.

00:10:54.610 --> 00:10:55.420
However,

00:10:56.200 --> 00:11:00.440
if Goku is appointed a war god
 alongside Nataku...

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:05.440
For Li Touten who is taking advantage 
of Nataku, of course, Goku would be...

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:09.660
But that would make you the
 guardian of a war god, Konzen,

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:12.500
which means you would be in his way.

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:20.690
<i>The cherry blossoms were so pretty, 
I wished Nataku could have been there, too.</i>

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:23.220
<i>It made me a little sad.</i>

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:27.750
Would you guys stop talking 
about depressing stuff?

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.370
Just enjoy the sake and flowers.

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:31.450
Yeah, yeah, we know.

00:11:31.780 --> 00:11:36.460
Though the flowers on Earth are 
much prettier than the ones here.

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:39.200
Aren't they the same cherry blossoms?

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:42.720
They live a different life.

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:44.660
I see.

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:47.560
I would love to see them.

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:53.400
I'm sorry, Konzen!

00:11:54.510 --> 00:11:58.010
Nice catch, Konzen! Well done, Dad!

00:11:58.010 --> 00:12:01.370
Why the hell did you have to fall on me
 of all people, you stupid monkey?!

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:02.820
I couldn't help it!

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:04.230
That was definitely your fault, Konzen.

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:05.430
What?!

00:12:05.430 --> 00:12:08.620
Goku weighs more than 
a hundred kilos with his shackles.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.030
Of course the branch would break.

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:14.550
<i>I was surrounded by the people I loved,
 and we were all laughing.</i>

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:16.710
<i>That's all it was.</i>

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:21.160
<i>That's all it was, but that was enough.</i>

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:24.300
<i>I thought it would last forever.</i>

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:28.960
It appears you've been wounded again.

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:30.970
It must hurt.

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:34.250
My poor boy, Nataku.

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:39.450
You are my pride.

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:45.140
<i>The moment we're alone, 
Father becomes extremely nice to me.</i>

00:12:45.600 --> 00:12:48.410
You are me.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:52.080
<i>This is the side of my father 
that frightens me the most.</i>

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:53.910
<i>He scares me, but...</i>

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:58.420
You're all that I have, Nataku.

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:02.790
<i>I become unable to move... 
unable to struggle...</i>

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:06.170
<i>Because I end up believing 
that there's actually love.</i>

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:10.510
Shortly after I took my 
post as field marshal,

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:16.100
a slew of giant demons started 
to appear on Earth with alarming frequency.

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:20.530
In all honesty, it was more than 
our forces could handle.

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:28.470
Li Touten was a smart man who rose in 
the ranks to become the Tentei's secretary.

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:33.040
But he came from a ruined family and
 couldn't deal with the prejudices he faced.

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:36.420
He ended up despising everyone above him.

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:39.410
Then one day, Li Touten...

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:41.220
Who is that?

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:43.550
One who is allowed to kill.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:47.430
He is the War God Prince Nataku.

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:53.060
And I'm sure you know all about 
Nataku's work as the war god since then.

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:56.830
What I'm about to say 
is just my own speculation.

00:13:57.740 --> 00:14:02.630
Nataku's true identity is top secret 
between the Tentei and the top brass,

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:03.950
but...

00:14:04.550 --> 00:14:07.420
I believe that he is an artificial 
human created by Li Touten.

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:10.150
You could probably even call him a weapon.

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:14.630
It's just a potential theory
 going around our forces,

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:17.460
but they say he's half demon and half god.

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:19.700
There's no way that would be allowed.

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:22.240
But it is being allowed.

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:26.080
Apparently, Heaven needed 
a war god that badly.

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:31.510
However, I believe Li Touten 
himself created that needed.

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:33.010
What?

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:37.010
A suddenly increasing number of battles, 
an overwhelmed army...

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:39.520
Don't you think the timing 
was rather convenient?

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:43.740
I'm not sure what his ultimate goal is,

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:48.240
but I'm sure that he will do 
whatever he can to get rid of Goku,

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:50.530
who could become a war god 
and threaten his well-being.

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:53.010
Even if it means using Nataku.

00:14:53.010 --> 00:14:54.780
What do you mean?

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:56.570
Goku...

00:14:57.150 --> 00:15:01.030
What do you mean by "get rid of me"?

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:02.680
It's not true, right?

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:04.570
Nataku wouldn't...

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:07.580
Goku! That idiot!

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:08.710
Wait, Goku!

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:11.720
<i>It's not true. Nataku wouldn't...</i>

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:14.460
<i>We're friends.</i>

00:15:14.460 --> 00:15:16.900
<i>He said he wanted to play together.</i>

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:19.020
<i>That's right. My name...</i>

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:21.120
<i>I have to tell him my name.</i>

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:22.190
<i>My name...</i>

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.450
Goku!

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:29.540
Will you be able to remain
 that little shrimp's sun?

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:33.220
<i>What can I possibly do?</i>

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:37.350
<i>I can't even catch up to him...</i>

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:38.550
Damn it!

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:41.760
War God Prince Nataku, come forth.

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:47.040
Nataku's army is being dispatched again.

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:49.700
Which means we get to take it easy.

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:52.160
It's all thanks to the great war god prince.

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:54.810
<i>All these bastards acting 
like nothing's wrong...</i>

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:56.970
<i>This is bullshit.</i>

00:15:57.210 --> 00:16:01.380
We're leaving this next subjugation 
to you as well, Li Touten.

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:02.180
As you wish.

00:16:02.180 --> 00:16:04.530
Let go! Let go of me!

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:05.410
Who's this kid?

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:06.760
Hey! Stop struggling!

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:08.100
Nataku!

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:09.980
It's not true, right?

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:12.850
You trying to kill me is a lie, right, Nataku?

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:14.380
Goku?

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:18.360
Looks like you've learned 
more than you needed to.

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:19.620
It was probably Tenpou.

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:21.860
Well, that's all right.

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:23.500
Kill him.

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:25.830
Right here, right now.

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:28.040
You bastard!

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:32.650
This is all your fault!

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:35.330
You keep saying all these
 weird things to Nataku!

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:38.960
Nata...

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:41.390
Get away from my father.

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.950
My father is my master.

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:46.980
No matter what he says or does to me,

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:50.310
my father is my only reason for living.

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:54.360
Anyone who harms my father, 
no matter who they are,

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:55.370
will be killed!

00:16:57.270 --> 00:16:58.150
Ken-nii!

00:16:58.150 --> 00:16:59.160
Run, Goku!

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:01.770
You're going to interfere, General Kenren?

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:05.910
Very well. Kill him as well, Nataku!

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:08.170
Ken-niichan?!

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:11.670
Stop, Nataku! What are you doing?!

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:16.270
<i>I can't let him fight Goku, no matter what!</i>

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:22.340
I said stop... I don't want this anymore!

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:26.600
<i>What's going on here?</i>

00:17:27.970 --> 00:17:31.360
You are truly my son, Nataku!

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:32.730
<i>Li Touten.</i>

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:33.730
Pardon me.

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:41.480
Ten-chan!

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:44.610
You're as bold as ever.

00:17:44.610 --> 00:17:47.790
I thought there'd be no end to this otherwise.

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:50.110
Well, there's certainly no turning back now.

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:52.540
I never intended on turning back anyway.

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:01.540
Ken-niichan! Ten-chan!

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:03.710
He's on a totally different level.

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:06.060
So this is the power of a war god prince...

00:18:06.490 --> 00:18:08.640
Make him stop, Li Touten!

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:10.600
We're in the presence of the Tentei...

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:11.930
What of it?

00:18:11.930 --> 00:18:12.400
What?

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:15.660
I'm asking you what difference it makes.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:17.280
Goku, run!

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:17.790
No!

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:18.600
Goku!

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:20.650
Kill him.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:22.160
Kill him.

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:23.660
Kill him.

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:25.160
Kill him.

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:27.160
Kill him!

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:42.140
Nataku.

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:44.320
My name...

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:46.560
is Goku.

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:47.800
It's nice to officially meet you.

00:18:50.180 --> 00:18:56.800
I'll show you all the good hiding places 
and where lots of raspberries grow.

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:02.210
Goku...

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:08.780
Someday...

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:16.910
What's going on?!

00:19:17.290 --> 00:19:20.590
You idiot! Hey, medics! I need some cloth!

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:22.060
How could this have happened?

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:30.060
Goku, not over there. This way.

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:30.800
Huh?

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:33.660
Look, that tree over there...

00:19:34.510 --> 00:19:36.090
Up top...

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:38.400
There's a bird's nest up there.

00:19:40.230 --> 00:19:41.600
You can see it, right?

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:52.540
Hey, where is that?

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:54.380
Nataku...

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:57.550
You need to wake up and show me.

00:19:58.070 --> 00:20:00.780
I can't see it!

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:02.620
Unhand him!

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:04.930
That's my son.

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:06.970
Li Touten...

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:09.270
Have no fear.

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:12.480
We can still use him. {M: he says "this" but I'm not sure if it's clear that he's referring to his son as a thing... if it is please use that instead. I guess we could use this thing?}{ED: I think it's probably clear enough. I think there's been at least once I've had to change "this thing" or the like to a pronoun just to make it sound better in English, so even if this doesn't sound as mean as it should be, it at least fits with what we've used prior. ...I think.}

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:14.550
You bastard...

00:20:14.550 --> 00:20:18.240
You pushed Nataku this far 
and you still don't get it?!

00:20:18.240 --> 00:20:21.300
He wasn't even allowed to do something 
as normal as playing with a friend...

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:26.280
And yet... And yet, the pain Nataku felt 
from not being able to defy you...

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:29.590
Goku!

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:34.620
Let go! Let go of me!

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:35.820
Stop!

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:37.540
What the hell are you doing?!

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:40.010
Restrain the traitors!

00:20:40.310 --> 00:20:42.190
Goku! Goku!

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:48.510
Wh-What is this?

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:55.350
Despite its small size, it's a rather 
ferocious animal with golden eyes.

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:58.970
G-Goku?

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:40.000
<b>Episode 6
 "Promise"</b>

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:38.210
Episode 6, "Promise."

00:22:38.210 --> 00:22:40.010
Watch without fail.

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:42.000
<b>Lettering: Seki Toshihiko</b>

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:42.000
<b>Ura Sai</b>

00:22:40.010 --> 00:22:41.020
Ready, and...

00:22:41.020 --> 00:22:42.000
Ura Sai.

00:22:44.200 --> 00:22:46.910
It sure is hot on the down on Earth.

00:22:46.910 --> 00:22:48.140
Where is he?

00:22:48.140 --> 00:22:50.890
It took me a while to get 
ready, so I'm a bit late.

00:22:55.140 --> 00:22:56.640
<b>Lettering: Seki Toshihiko</b>

00:22:55.140 --> 00:22:56.640
<b>Ura Sai</b>

00:22:55.370 --> 00:22:56.640
Ura Sai.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:04.020
<b>East 1</b>

00:22:57.840 --> 00:22:58.820
What's up?

00:22:58.820 --> 00:23:02.090
The first platoon's uniforms are so dull.

00:23:02.090 --> 00:23:03.070
You think so?

00:23:03.070 --> 00:23:06.020
We should dress them up like 
that to add some character.

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:07.670
Yeah, no.
